# nixamp
===
 It really whips the terminal's ass. Open-source streaming platform: turn a folder into a live radio station, TV channel or film night anyone can tune into. Terminal player, web app and desktop app on one engine, with a public directory, rooms, live subtitles and x402 pay-to-listen. Nothing uploaded, no platform in the middle.
